      "sourceText": "两个输入必须形成配对才进入发布回调。源码没有设置最大配对时间差，也没有将输入位姿插值到点云时间：位姿取配对的里程计消息，机械 TF 按点云时间查询，输出 TF 与 `odometry` 都标记为点云时间。近似配对不等于同一采样时刻；实际配对误差和运动影响仍需验证。",
      "translatedText": "Both inputs must form a pair before entering the publish callback\\. The source code does not set a maximum pairing time difference, nor does it interpolate the input pose to the point cloud time: the pose is taken from the paired odometry message, the mechanical TF is queried at the point cloud time, and the output TF and `odometry` are both marked with the point cloud time\\. Approximate pairing is not equivalent to the same sampling instant; the actual pairing error and motion effects still need to be verified\\.",
